&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-style: italic;"&gt;(1) The Partnership has fixed rate fuel contracts with two of its interstate pipelines which specifies the treatment for those customers on the pipeline. If the Partnership utilized fuel in excess amounts provided by shippers, then the Partnership is required to purchase the specified amount of gas to operate the pipeline. If the Partnership does not utilize the fuel provided by shippers, then the Partnership can sell the excess gas. For the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024 the Partnership had excess gas and generated revenue from the sale of gas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Contract Balances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
