&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;Utility Plant accruals were nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;at both&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;Amortization expenses of intangible assets total $330 thousand fot the years ending&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;and 2024, respectively. Estimated amortization expense is $702 thousand for each of the years 2026 to 2030.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;Gross additions to Utility Plant (less nuclear fuel) on the Statement of Cash Flows excludes $18 million and nil as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively, of non-cash transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;The composite weighted-average depreciation rates were 3.28% and 3.10% for the years ended December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;and December 31, 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statement of Income was $36 thousand in 2025 (an equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;of $30.5 thousand and an interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;of $5.5 thousand) and -$93 thousand in 2024 (an equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;of -$80 thousand and an interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;of -$13 thousand).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold;"&gt;7. Long-Term Debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
