&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-style: italic;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-style: italic;"&gt;1 Requires quarterly interest payments due on the first day of March, June, September and December of each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-style: italic;"&gt;2 Requires quarterly interest payments due on the first day of February, May, August and November of each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;We may repay the senior unsecured notes, at our option, at any time subject to a make-whole provision and certain financial covenants set forth in our uncommitted Private Shelf Facility. Vector Pipeline Limited Partnership is the guarantor of our senior unsecured notes. As at December 31, 2025, we were in compliance with all debt covenants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Annual Debt Maturities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;As at December 31, 2025, we have commitments as detailed below:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
