&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-style: italic;"&gt;1.As at December 31, 2025, interest payable of $5 thousand (2024 - $16 thousand) and $494 thousand (2024 - $501 thousand) were included in &amp;#8220;Accounts Payable to Associated Companies&amp;#8221; and &amp;#8220;Interest Accrued&amp;#8221;, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold;"&gt;8. Assets under Capital Lease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;On February 25, 2025, we renewed our lease of the Milford-Belle River Mills Loop pipeline segment for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;an additional 15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#8209;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;year term beginning on December 1, 2025. As the renewal established new fixed lease&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;payments, the related lease liability and right&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#8209;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#8209;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;use asset was remeasured in accordance with ASC 842.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
