&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, we recorded $1.9 million and $1.6 million of depreciation expense related to our finance lease that is recorded in Depreciation and amortization expense in the Statement of Income.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, we incurred interest expense on our finance lease obligation of $1.6 million and $1.2 million, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;Under the terms of the finance lease, payments are due on the first of each month. As at December 31, 2025, our finance lease liability is expected to mature as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
