&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;The Partnership's Federal net deferred tax liability was approximately $35,039 thousand and $36,744 thousand for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The Partnership's net state deferred tax liability was approximately $8,104 thousand and $8,535 thousand at December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
