&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;In 2018&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;pursuant to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;guidance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;established&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;in FERC Docket No. PL19-2-000, the Partnership began amortizing the regulated liability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;utilizing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;the Reverse South Georgia flowback&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;over the remaining 15.4-year life of the assets. The amortization is recorded to deferred tax expense account 411.1 with an offset to regulatory liability account 254.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold;"&gt;10. Related Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;Related party transactions are provided in the normal course of business and, unless otherwise noted,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;are measured at the exchange amount, which is the amount of consideration established and agreed to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;by the related parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos;"&gt;Our transactions with related parties are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
