    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHCCFB0A29FEDCD6CA24E89C1D9F6BFD50" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Vector's latest rate case settlement, approved by the FERC in &#1048663;s order dated December 28, 2009 in Docket No. RP09- 431-000, authorized the continued use of Vector's RP03-489-000 underlying settlement ROE of 12.75%. The 12.75% ROE was imputed from the capital structure, weighted cost of debt, and income tax factor underlying the 12.96% pre-tax rate of return approved by FERC in its order dated January 29, 2004 in Docket No. RP03-489-000&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
